   ->  Index Scan using sf_w on public.sf
         Output: id, COALESCE(weave_current_fused_distance('sf_w'::regclass, ctid, '''alpha'''::wquery, '''beta'''::wquery, '{1,2}'::real[]), fuse(weave_lexscore((d <=> '''alpha'''::wquery)), weave_lexscore((d <=> '''beta'''::wquery)), '{1,2}'::real[]))
         Order By: ((sf.d <=> '''alpha'''::wquery) AND (sf.d <=> '''beta'''::wquery) AND (sf.d <~> '{1,2}'::real[]))
